27048_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260330/202603302226527048_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260330/202603302226527048_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">据西媒塞尔电台消息，维克托・穆尼奥斯、尼科·帕斯以及恩德里克都将在本赛季结束后回归皇马，三人将一同随队参加季前备战。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-30/69ca895db6fddnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：萨拉赫认为自己有权质疑被弃用，红军内部认为送走他很明智</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.45" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251020/68f5a0626177e.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.45" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.45" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251020/68f5a0626177e.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251020/68f5a0626177e.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">《回声报》利物浦跟队记者Paul Gorst发文谈到了萨拉赫离队更多的幕后情况。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-30/69ca8a798926enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：相比罗德里，恩佐更可能加盟皇马，弗洛伦蒂诺不想签罗德里</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.77" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260330/202603302247436751.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.77" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.77" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260330/202603302247436751_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260330/202603302247436751_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">据马卡电台报道，记者Raúl Varela在节目中谈到了恩佐以及罗德里加盟皇马的可能性，相比之下恩佐转会可能性更大。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-30/69ca8f24f382cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">曼市双雄直接竞争！罗马诺：曼联、曼城都有意安德森+托纳利</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260330/202603302301564602.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260330/202603302301564602_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260330/202603302301564602_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">知名记者罗马诺发布社媒，表示曼联以及曼城都有意托纳利和安德森，曼市双雄将在引援上展开直接竞争。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-31/69ca9c5447ae8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">大中锋伤了😢斯卡洛尼赛前谈帕尼切利伤情落泪，发布会随之结束</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260331/202603310014528731_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260331/202603310014528731_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260331/202603310014528731_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">阿根廷主帅斯卡洛尼在赛前发布会谈及刚刚遭遇重伤、无缘世界杯的队内年轻中锋帕尼切利，斯帅不禁动情落泪。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-31/69caaa94d9067native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">ESPN：拉菲尼亚希望赶上5月11日国家德比 FIFA伤病赔偿至少15万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260328/69c6d85d42899_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260328/69c6d85d42899.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260328/69c6d85d42899.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">ESPN报道，巴西国脚拉菲尼亚因大腿