ition: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.97" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.97" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260331/202603310502374359.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260331/202603310502374359.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">据慢镜头报道称，一名意大利士兵逗留训练场观看波黑训练，被波黑方指责为间谍。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-31/69caeb0320d41native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">RAC1：拉菲尼亚受伤后精神层面深受打击，巴萨允许他暂时留在巴西</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260328/69c6d854ead6a_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260328/69c6d854ead6a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260328/69c6d854ead6a.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">据RAC1报道称，拉菲尼亚在受伤后情绪低落。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-31/69caefd243f06native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：巴萨将向莱万提供大幅度降薪的续约，头号目标是引进小蜘蛛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251217/6941e2b41eea0_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; hei